      "content": "That's actually a really good start. It sounds much more premium than I expected. I think I can use parts of that for the main landing page.\n\nOne thing though—I just showed this to the client and they're already looking at the SEO score from their tool. They're a bit disappointed that the number isn't higher. They're saying that even if it sounds \"luxury,\" if it doesn't hit the keyword density they're used to, their system won't even show it to customers.\n\nCan you try a second version? Try to weave those keywords in a bit more frequently so the score goes up, but seriously, try to keep that same high-end, elegant vibe. Don't let it turn into a list of words, just... make the keywords more \"present\" in the text if that makes sense?",
